1
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:34,930
[In My Prime]

2
00:01:35,229 --> 00:01:37,720
[Episode 3]

3
00:01:49,770 --> 00:01:50,229
Aihua.

4
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,520
Aihua.

5
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:52,960
Aihua.

6
00:01:55,229 --> 00:01:57,090
Why are you sleeping at this hour?

7
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:58,640
How many times have I emphasized

8
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,680
the rules at the mine?

9
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,140
No sleeping underground or at the pithead.

10
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:01,860
Look at you!

11
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,120
They are looking to
make an example of someone right now.

12
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:06,120
Aren't you just asking for trouble?

13
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:07,070
Dongfang,

14
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,160
I just dozed off for a bit.

15
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,400
Don't call me Dongfang.

16
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,730
It's working hours now.

17
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,500
Be serious!

18
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:13,650
Alright, alright.

19
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:14,880
Chief Cao.

20
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,390
Don't worry.

21
00:02:16,390 --> 00:02:17,840
I just dozed off for a bit.

22
00:02:18,079 --> 00:02:19,410
It won't hold things up.

23
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:20,840
Alright.

24
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:22,120
I'll go down the mine then.

25
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,120
Stop right there!

26
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:24,960
Come with me to my office

27
00:02:25,150 --> 00:02:26,680
and write a formal apology.

28
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:28,630
Dongfang.

29
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:29,000
No,

30
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:29,790
Chief Cao.

31
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:30,650
I promise

32
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,910
I won't make mistakes again.

33
00:02:31,910 --> 00:02:33,110
This is the last time.

34
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,690
I was wrong. I was wrong.

35
00:02:36,710 --> 00:02:39,470
It's mainly because I've been going down the mine
for a few nights,

36
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:41,600
and I really couldn't take it anymore.

37
00:02:42,750 --> 00:02:44,430
Going down the mine for a few nights?

38
00:02:44,430 --> 00:02:44,890
Well...

39
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,240
You weren't even scheduled

40
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,840
for the recent night shifts.

41
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,750
I thought

42
00:02:51,890 --> 00:02:52,680
if I could go down one more time,

43
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,680
I would.

44
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:55,800
Last time,

45
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:59,079
I took Sweetie to Haizhou

46
00:02:59,870 --> 00:03:00,870
to see a doctor.

47
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:02,400
The doctor said

48
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,530
her "white hair" condition

49
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,240
needs long-term care.

50
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,160
Things like Vitamin C

51
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:10,060
and other common medicines

52
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:11,590
must always be kept at home.

53
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,120
So I thought

54
00:03:13,650 --> 00:03:14,710
I'd save more money

55
00:03:14,770 --> 00:03:16,100
to buy medicine for her.

56
00:03:16,470 --> 00:03:16,960
Aihua.

57
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,430
Qi Shi's medical bills

58
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:21,240
are on me from now on.

59
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,530
That won't do.

60
00:03:22,810 --> 00:03:24,000
I can't always let you pay.

61
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,530
You gave me money last time.

62
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:26,750
Dongfang.

63
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:27,910
No, Chief Cao.

64
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,490
If you just let me off this time,

65
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,250
you'll be doing me a huge favor.

66
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,490
Otherwise, three months' salary

67
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,140
will be gone.

68
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:36,740
I still have a family to feed.

69
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,590
Please?

70
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,280
Thank you, Dongfang.

71
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,420
No, thank you, Chief Cao.

72
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:44,150
Thank you, Chief Cao.

73
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:44,680
I promise

74
00:03:45,079 --> 00:03:46,310
there won't be a next time.

75
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,770
There won't be a next time.

76
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,250
We're colleagues.

77
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,210
Just give me an employee discount.

78
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:05,190
Next time,

79
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,030
when you come to our place

80
00:04:06,030 --> 00:04:07,360
to buy groceries,

81
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,960
I'll give you some extra.

82
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,440
I can't make that call.

83
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,120
Go talk to Hu Yitong.

84
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,780
Okay, okay.

85
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,100
I'll go find Hu Yitong.

86
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:19,360
Not bad, not bad.

87
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:24,550
Take this one.

88
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,720
Welcome.

89
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:30,630
Qi Shi,

90
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,659
you're starting school soon,

91
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,270
right?

92
00:04:33,540 --> 00:04:34,750
Take a look at these things.

93
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:35,810
Whatever you like,

94
00:04:35,830 --> 00:04:37,240
just tell me.

95
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,159
It's

96
00:04:38,190 --> 00:04:39,750
a back-to-school gift for you,

97
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:40,190
okay?

98
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,360
Go take a look.

99
00:04:42,390 --> 00:04:42,870
Cao Xin,

100
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:44,800
didn't you want that

101
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:46,490
"One Hundred Thousand Whys"?

102
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,950
I will buy it for you today,

103
00:04:47,950 --> 00:04:48,360
okay?

104
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:51,630
Look.

105
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,800
These two colors are different.

106
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,080
Excuse me.

107
00:04:56,550 --> 00:04:57,640
Please get me this,

108
00:04:57,670 --> 00:04:58,720
"One Hundred Thousand Whys".

109
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,070
Sure.

110
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,190
This whole set, right?

111
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:02,560
Yes.

112
00:05:42,950 --> 00:05:44,070
You get the toy car,

113
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:46,450
and I'll buy "One Hundred Thousand Whys".

114
00:05:46,450 --> 00:05:47,680
I'll do your homework for a week

115
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,409
in exchange.

116
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,770
Half a month.

117
00:06:00,070 --> 00:06:00,600
Deal.

118
00:06:04,070 --> 00:06:05,030
I like cars.

119
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:06,070
Uncle Cao.

120
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:10,040
Qi Shi likes cars, huh?

121
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:11,040
Alright.

122
00:06:11,310 --> 00:06:11,680
Okay.

123
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,120
Qi Shi wants the car,

124
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,920
and Cao Xin wants the books.

125
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:16,430
Right?

126
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,260
-Yes.
-Yes.

127
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:17,750
Okay.

128
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:26,480
Cao Xin.

129
00:06:29,750 --> 00:06:30,680
Drink your milk.

130
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:35,270
Good job.

131
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:37,230
Are you tired?

132
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,310
Isn't this Qi Shi's?

133
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:45,750
Why do you have it?

134
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,270
Qi Shi said

135
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:49,600
Aunt Huo has been

136
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:50,870
in a bad mood these days,

137
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:52,190
so she left the toy car model

138
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,050
with me for now.

139
00:06:53,070 --> 00:06:54,390
Your Aunt Huo

140
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,980
has a sharp tongue,

141
00:06:56,190 --> 00:06:56,990
but deep down,

142
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,430
she's warmer than anyone.

143
00:06:58,430 --> 00:06:59,480
At school,

144
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,050
take good care of Qi Shi.

145
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,750
Don't let anyone bully her.

146
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:03,310
Got it?

147
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:06,120
I want to wear a red scarf to school too.

148
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,040
You're not a Young Pioneer yet.

149
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,310
Why would you wear a red scarf?

150
00:07:08,310 --> 00:07:09,170
Go to sleep now.

151
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,190
Cao Xin wears one,
so I want to wear one too.

152
00:07:11,190 --> 00:07:11,630
Did you put the magnifying glass

153
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:12,870
in your backpack?

154
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,630
I did.

155
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,260
Go to sleep.

156
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,780
Go to sleep.

157
00:08:12,390 --> 00:08:13,950
My daughter is so pretty.

158
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,480
Is this really my daughter?

159
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,920
Is this really my sister?

160
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:18,480
Sweetie,

161
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:20,240
do you know what this is called?

162
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,070
It's called

163
00:08:21,310 --> 00:08:22,830
a mouse falling into a water jar.

164
00:08:22,830 --> 00:08:23,870
What does that mean, Dad?

165
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:25,200
It means you look slick!

166
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,340
From now on,

167
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,870
no one will laugh at you anymore

168
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:28,830
and call you the White-Haired Girl.

169
00:08:28,830 --> 00:08:30,040
Thanks, Dad.

170
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:32,110
We're family, no need to thank me.

171
00:08:32,110 --> 00:08:32,909
This is all...

172
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,370
Sweetie,

173
00:08:37,909 --> 00:08:39,000
Dad has another

174
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:40,289
secret weapon for you.

175
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:41,120
Look.

176
00:08:41,669 --> 00:08:42,360
From now on,

177
00:08:42,549 --> 00:08:43,909
if the words on the blackboard

178
00:08:43,909 --> 00:08:45,440
are too small for you to see,

179
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,400
just use this.

180
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:46,910
Look.

181
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:47,600
Then

182
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,390
look through it like this.

183
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:50,250
Come on, try it.

184
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:56,890
How is it?

185
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:58,930
Thanks, Dad.

186
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:00,600
All right.

187
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:02,010
Go eat your breakfast.

188
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:02,790
Otherwise, on your first day,

189
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:04,030
you'll be late for school.

190
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:04,560
Hurry up.

191
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,480
Honey,

192
00:09:12,670 --> 00:09:14,130
I should give you an award.

193
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:16,510
The Award for Selfless Dedication.

194
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:18,910
Look.

195
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,920
Our daughter looks so energetic today.

196
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,630
It's clearly all your doing.

197
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:24,510
But you

198
00:09:24,670 --> 00:09:26,120
gave all the credit to me,

199
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:28,380
letting me take such a big advantage.

200
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:29,510
Honey.

201
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:30,910
What kind of blessing did I earn

202
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:32,080
in my past life

203
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,960
to marry a wonderful wife like you?

204
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,290
Do you think everyone is like you,

205
00:09:35,290 --> 00:09:36,270
making a fuss over the smallest thing

206
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:38,130
and letting the whole world know?

207
00:09:39,270 --> 00:09:39,720
Aihua.

208
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:40,670
Aihua.

209
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:41,840
Dongfang.

210
00:09:42,270 --> 00:09:43,910
Today is Qi Shi's first day of school.

211
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:44,770
Let me take her.

212
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:45,780
No need.

213
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,750
I'll take her.

214
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:47,870
Let me take her.

215
00:09:47,870 --> 00:09:49,030
Cao Xin is going too.

216
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,080
You just do your work.

217
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,390
No need to take up your time.

218
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:52,250
Let me take her.

219
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:53,840
Cao Xin.

220
00:09:53,870 --> 00:09:54,390
Come on.

221
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:56,750
Hurry up.

222
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:58,500
Starting today,

223
00:09:58,550 --> 00:09:59,080
Qi Shi

224
00:09:59,670 --> 00:10:00,240
is a proud

225
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:01,870
elementary school student.

226
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:02,810
Come, get down.

227
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,240
Qi Shi.

228
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:07,590
If anything happens,

229
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,590
find the teacher. Do you hear me?

230
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:11,080
Or go find Cao Xin.

231
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:12,120
Cao Xin,

232
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,600
take good care of Qi Shi.

233
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,570
Don't let anyone bully her.

234
00:10:14,570 --> 00:10:15,370
Do you hear me?

235
00:10:15,390 --> 00:10:16,120
Okay, go.

236
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,200
Qi Shi,

237
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:22,390
don't be nervous.

238
00:10:22,510 --> 00:10:24,310
Cao Xin, take good care of Qi Shi.

239
00:10:24,550 --> 00:10:26,080
Don't let anyone bully her.

240
00:10:31,930 --> 00:10:32,790
Isn't this Qi Zhi's

241
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:33,720
monster sister?

242
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,150
Yeah.

243
00:10:34,170 --> 00:10:35,630
Isn't she the White-Haired Girl?

244
00:10:35,630 --> 00:10:37,560
Yeah, how did your hair turn black?

245
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:49,860
What do you think?

246
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:50,600
You can't master this skill

247
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,150
without over ten years of practice.

248
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:53,150
It's so accurate.

249
00:10:53,390 --> 00:10:55,030
My hand is a scale.

250
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,270
And look at this scale.

251
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:57,150
It's facing you,

252
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:58,670
I don't even need to look at it.

253
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:00,910
I even perform this
when foreign guests come.

254
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:01,510
Two bucks.

255
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:02,080
Okay.

256
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:06,030
Take care.

257
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:09,960
Qinglian.

258
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:11,600
Did you know?

259
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,220
Cao Dongfang's family

260
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,630
got a telephone installed.

261
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:15,320
I heard

262
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:17,000
it cost 4,000 yuan,

263
00:11:17,270 --> 00:11:18,960
and they had to
find connections to wait in line

264
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,910
just to get it.

265
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:22,870
Spending so much money on that thing.

266
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:25,790
Why install it? Honestly.

267
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,670
I wouldn't install one
even if I had the money.

268
00:11:27,670 --> 00:11:28,750
If I had money, I'd save it

269
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:30,150
for the kids' education.

270
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,080
Exactly.

271
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,320
Our mine is so small.

272
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:35,320
You can hear a fart
from one end to the other.

273
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,790
And he still installed a phone.

274
00:11:36,790 --> 00:11:37,270
Yeah.

275
00:11:37,290 --> 00:11:38,410
What a show-off.

276
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:39,960
Why...

277
00:11:40,510 --> 00:11:42,510
Why does my left eye keep twitching?

278
00:11:42,870 --> 00:11:44,030
Could Qi Shi

279
00:11:44,030 --> 00:11:45,360
be getting into trouble

280
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,440
on her first day at school?

281
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:48,870
Let me see, let me see, let me see.

282
00:11:48,870 --> 00:11:52,440
Five, six, seven, eight.

283
00:11:53,000 --> 00:12:00,510
Four, two, three, four.
Five, six, seven, stop.

284
00:12:10,570 --> 00:12:11,840
Do you want to see a magic show?

285
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,100
Let's see. What magic?

286
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,480
Black to white, white to black.

287
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:16,440
You can't tell the difference.

288
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,030
Where is it?

289
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:17,570
Where is it?

290
00:12:17,570 --> 00:12:18,100
Let's go!

291
00:12:24,910 --> 00:12:25,670
Give it back to me!

292
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:26,530
Come and get it.

293
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,460
Give it to me. Give it to me.

294
00:12:33,390 --> 00:12:34,270
Come on. Come on.

295
00:12:34,270 --> 00:12:34,730
Come on.

296
00:12:35,030 --> 00:12:35,890
Come and get it.

297
00:12:36,910 --> 00:12:38,440
Why aren't you grabbing it?

298
00:12:39,870 --> 00:12:40,800
Come and grab it.

299
00:12:42,510 --> 00:12:43,910
Come and get it if you can.

300
00:12:48,630 --> 00:12:49,230
Hold this.

301
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,200
How dare you hit me?

302
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:53,060
What are you two doing? Come help.

303
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,760
Can't find your glasses?

304
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,840
Can't see, right?

305
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,900
Teach her a lesson.

306
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:10,720
How dare you hit my sister?

307
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,670
You're asking for this!

308
00:13:11,670 --> 00:13:12,730
Boss, are you okay?

309
00:13:13,510 --> 00:13:14,790
Qi Zhi, you've got nerve.

310
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:15,870
Delivering yourself to us.

311
00:13:15,870 --> 00:13:16,670
Let's beat him up too!

312
00:13:16,670 --> 00:13:18,390
That's for bullying my sister!

313
00:13:18,390 --> 00:13:20,120
That's for bullying my sister!

314
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:21,670
I'll kill you!

315
00:13:22,030 --> 00:13:22,630
Are you okay?

316
00:13:22,630 --> 00:13:23,120
I'm fine.

317
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:23,720
Come on.

318
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,000
Wear it, quick.

319
00:13:26,790 --> 00:13:27,240
Kick him!

320
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:27,720
Let me go!

321
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,360
Kick him. Kick him!

322
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:28,910
Let me go!

323
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:29,440
Kick him!

324
00:13:29,790 --> 00:13:30,240
Let go!

325
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,390
Get out of here.
It's none of your business!

326
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:33,080
Let go of me!

327
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:35,130
Get out of here!

328
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:36,720
Let me go!

329
00:13:36,750 --> 00:13:37,280
You brat!

330
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:38,870
Are you a dog?

331
00:13:39,550 --> 00:13:39,960
I...

332
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:44,870
The teacher is here!

333
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,220
Who's fighting? Stop!

334
00:13:48,790 --> 00:13:49,920
Let go of your hands.

335
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:57,960
The spring breeze blows.
The spring breeze blows.

336
00:13:56,720 --> 00:14:00,700
[Qingwu Elementary School]

337
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,670
Blowing the willows green.

338
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:04,440
Speak.

339
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:06,670
Who started it?

340
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:07,910
She started it.

341
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:09,480
I don't even know how I provoked her.

342
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:10,760
She acted like she was crazy.

343
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:11,760
My... my arm

344
00:14:11,790 --> 00:14:12,600
was sprained by her.

345
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,770
I can't even move it now.

346
00:14:13,770 --> 00:14:15,200
My face is ruined by her scratches.

347
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,480
My sister's face is ruined too.

348
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,010
You even broke her glasses.

349
00:14:18,030 --> 00:14:18,690
Principal,

350
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,250
we demand she be expelled.

351
00:14:20,270 --> 00:14:21,920
If anyone gets expelled,
it should be you first!

352
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:22,750
Three 6th graders

353
00:14:22,750 --> 00:14:23,670
were beating up a second grader.

354
00:14:23,670 --> 00:14:24,330
Shameless!

355
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,630
Who are you calling shameless?

356
00:14:25,630 --> 00:14:27,270
Say that again!

357
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,600
Shameless!

358
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:29,570
Shameless!

359
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:33,000
A little conflict between students

360
00:14:34,150 --> 00:14:35,030
is normal, isn't it?

361
00:14:35,030 --> 00:14:36,000
I'll go tell my dad.

362
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,530
My dad is the mine director.

363
00:14:37,590 --> 00:14:39,630
A mine director outrank
a principal, right?

364
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:41,230
Let my dad judge who's right.

365
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,630
You troublemakers.

366
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:45,960
You came here

367
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,290
quite often, don't you?

368
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:49,510
None of you are easy to deal with.

369
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:51,240
But no matter what,

370
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,280
hitting people is always wrong.

371
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,160
Tell you what.

372
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,260
The student who threw the first punch

373
00:14:57,870 --> 00:14:58,960
should apologize,

374
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:01,270
and we'll let this matter go.

375
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,150
Hurry up and apologize!

376
00:15:03,150 --> 00:15:04,080
Say something!

377
00:15:04,550 --> 00:15:06,480
An apology is letting you off easy.

378
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,750
If you don't apologize,

379
00:15:07,750 --> 00:15:08,880
you'll be expelled.

380
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:09,670
Qi Shi.

381
00:15:20,910 --> 00:15:22,040
Apologize for what?

382
00:15:26,510 --> 00:15:27,710
What did you do wrong?

383
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:31,930
Look at this.

384
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:33,130
Let everyone see.

385
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,520
Her injuries

386
00:15:35,550 --> 00:15:37,280
are no less severe than theirs.

387
00:15:37,990 --> 00:15:39,060
She's just a girl.

388
00:15:39,150 --> 00:15:40,480
Who will take responsibility
if she's badly hurt?

389
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,460
My dad is rich. I'll take responsibility.

390
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:43,200
Just because your dad
is the mine director,

391
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,200
you think you can bully my daughter,

392
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:44,630
right?

393
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:45,670
Fine, fine, fine.

394
00:15:45,670 --> 00:15:47,120
School is just letting out now.

395
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,910
Let's have the other parents judge

396
00:15:48,910 --> 00:15:50,510
and see what kind of atmosphere
this school has.

397
00:15:50,510 --> 00:15:51,910
No need to do that.

398
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:54,860
Principal.

399
00:15:55,870 --> 00:15:56,550
I know my own daughter

400
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:57,440
very well.

401
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:00,480
She doesn't cause trouble,
but she's definitely not afraid of it.

402
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:00,910
Right, right.

403
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:01,890
I can figure it out

404
00:16:01,890 --> 00:16:02,800
with my eyes closed.

405
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:03,760
These brats

406
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:04,960
bullied my daughter first.

407
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:05,490
Exactly!

408
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:06,750
Do you admit it or not?

409
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:07,550
Admit what?

410
00:16:08,030 --> 00:16:09,080
Everyone saw it.

411
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,240
She started it.

412
00:16:10,270 --> 00:16:10,870
Who saw it?

413
00:16:10,870 --> 00:16:11,930
Tell me, who saw it?

414
00:16:12,660 --> 00:16:13,990
Principal, he's lying.

415
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:16,370
Our whole class saw it.

416
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,030
Those three

417
00:16:18,030 --> 00:16:19,230
bullied Qi Shi first.

418
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,140
Tian Zihao,

419
00:16:21,870 --> 00:16:22,870
isn't that right?

420
00:16:25,030 --> 00:16:25,690
Principal,

421
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:26,820
I can testify.

422
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,510
Our whole class saw it.

423
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:32,910
Tell me,

424
00:16:33,390 --> 00:16:33,960
did you guys

425
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,070
bully Qi Shi first?

426
00:16:35,410 --> 00:16:35,910
If you don't tell the truth,

427
00:16:35,910 --> 00:16:37,440
I'll go find your mom later.

428
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:41,630
Zhou Xuanyu suddenly took off

429
00:16:41,630 --> 00:16:42,670
Qi Shi's wig

430
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,270
and wouldn't give it back to Qi Shi.

431
00:16:45,270 --> 00:16:47,200
That's why they started fighting.

432
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:48,170
Principal,

433
00:16:48,550 --> 00:16:49,810
you heard that, right?

434
00:16:51,030 --> 00:16:52,830
Zhou Xuanyu clearly started it,

435
00:16:52,870 --> 00:16:53,960
yet he twisted the facts

436
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:55,290
and blamed my daughter.

437
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:56,320
Let me tell you,

438
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,600
you deserved to be beaten.

439
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:59,560
You're so pathetic. You asked for it.

440
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:00,270
You've completely disgraced

441
00:17:00,270 --> 00:17:01,320
your father.

442
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:03,570
Principal,

443
00:17:04,390 --> 00:17:06,030
my daughter wasn't fighting.

444
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:07,400
It was self-defense.

445
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:09,180
If she hadn't fought back,

446
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,960
she would be condoning school bullying.

447
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,680
It's encouraging bad behavior.

448
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,400
It's undermining

449
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,920
the standards of civility, morality,
and good conduct.

450
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,440
My mom is absolutely right.

451
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:17,030
Hey, you.

452
00:17:17,810 --> 00:17:18,880
The principal just said

453
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:21,010
whoever started it should apologize.

454
00:17:21,109 --> 00:17:22,310
Say sorry to Qi Shi.

455
00:17:24,510 --> 00:17:24,960
Say it!

456
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:26,829
Sorry.

457
00:17:28,310 --> 00:17:28,970
Principal.

458
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,660
The matter is settled.

459
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:33,250
I won't bother you anymore.

460
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,350
I have to go home

461
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:35,680
and cook for my children.

462
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,410
You guys be careful from now on.

463
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,410
Let's go.

464
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:05,640
No wonder Qi Shi is so amazing.

465
00:18:06,070 --> 00:18:08,180
Like mother, like daughter.

466
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:10,270
If only I had a mom like that.

467
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,940
How awesome would that be?

468
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:15,510
If only I had

469
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:16,370
a mom like that.

470
00:18:17,310 --> 00:18:18,440
I could walk around

471
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,640
like I own the school.

472
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:21,310
Right, Sis?

473
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:39,440
Cao Xin.

474
00:18:39,790 --> 00:18:40,830
Cao Xin, Si.

475
00:18:40,830 --> 00:18:41,200
Dad.

476
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,510
I heard you got into a fight.

477
00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:43,370
Where is Qi Shi?

478
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:45,110
Come on, take me to your teacher.

479
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:45,920
This is outrageous!

480
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,200
Dad, we're all fine.

481
00:18:47,790 --> 00:18:48,590
Aunt Huo just came

482
00:18:48,590 --> 00:18:49,750
and took Qi Shi home.

483
00:18:50,110 --> 00:18:51,790
Glad you're fine.

484
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:54,070
If this happens again,

485
00:18:54,070 --> 00:18:54,830
tell me.

486
00:18:55,030 --> 00:18:56,230
I'll stand up for you.

487
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,970
Don't let others bully you.

488
00:18:58,270 --> 00:19:00,000
Dad, I listened to you today.

489
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:01,960
As soon as something went wrong,

490
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,560
I hurried to get the teacher.

491
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:05,280
Cao Xin is such a good boy.

492
00:19:05,590 --> 00:19:07,200
Here, have some candy.

493
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:09,480
Dad,

494
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:10,740
I was awesome today too.

495
00:19:10,740 --> 00:19:11,830
During the fight,

496
00:19:11,850 --> 00:19:12,400
I secretly

497
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,850
kicked Zhou Xuanyu.

498
00:19:14,540 --> 00:19:16,060
Si is a brave kid.

499
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,070
Here.

500
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:19,400
I have two more pieces of candy.

501
00:19:21,230 --> 00:19:21,710
Let's go.

502
00:19:21,710 --> 00:19:23,160
Don't eat it yet.

503
00:19:32,030 --> 00:19:33,510
Mom, eat the banana.

504
00:19:36,350 --> 00:19:36,830
Honey,

505
00:19:37,030 --> 00:19:38,880
you're a real heroine.

506
00:19:39,920 --> 00:19:40,680
Turns out you're not only

507
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,070
tough at home,

508
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,530
but also bossy outside.

509
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:46,410
Word has spread all over the mine.

510
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:48,200
They say you scolded the principal

511
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,600
and scolded Zhou Xuanyu.

512
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:51,510
You were so logical when you got mad,

513
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:52,550
with good reasons.

514
00:19:52,550 --> 00:19:54,400
I heard the principal was scolded by you

515
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,550
so much that he turned green

516
00:19:55,550 --> 00:19:57,150
and didn't dare to say a word.

517
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:59,210
Dad, let me imitate Mom for you.

518
00:19:59,350 --> 00:20:00,960
I know my own daughter.

519
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:02,510
I know what she's up to

520
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:03,330
just by looking at her.

521
00:20:03,330 --> 00:20:04,810
Did I say that?

522
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:06,440
That sounds like something
your mom would say.

523
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,480
She doesn't cause trouble,

524
00:20:07,480 --> 00:20:09,480
but she's definitely not afraid of it.

525
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:09,920
Mom,

526
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,500
after what you did,

527
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:12,680
I bet no one at school

528
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,480
will dare to bully my sister again.

529
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,030
Mom,

530
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:17,240
Zhou Xuanyu hits really hard.

531
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:19,200
My face still hurts.

532
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,680
So you know it hurts.

533
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,440
Let it hurt.

534
00:20:23,750 --> 00:20:25,150
It'll teach you a lesson.

535
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,350
About you getting into a fight,

536
00:20:27,350 --> 00:20:29,490
I haven't even settled the score with you.

537
00:20:29,490 --> 00:20:30,590
Do you think what you did today

538
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:32,120
is something to be proud of?

539
00:20:32,350 --> 00:20:33,530
How many times do you expect your dad

540
00:20:33,530 --> 00:20:35,130
to fix these glasses for you?

541
00:20:35,590 --> 00:20:35,920
Go.

542
00:20:36,310 --> 00:20:38,310
Wash the mustard greens in the yard.

543
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,970
No dinner until you finish.

544
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:41,750
Mom,

545
00:20:42,310 --> 00:20:43,640
my sister is the victim.

546
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:46,440
It's my fault for being late today.

547
00:20:46,790 --> 00:20:48,440
Otherwise, that kid Zhou Xuanyu

548
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:51,300
wouldn't have been able to
lay a finger on my sister.

549
00:20:52,030 --> 00:20:52,760
Don't go out.

550
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,400
I can handle it alone.

551
00:21:01,590 --> 00:21:02,160
Brother.

552
00:21:02,310 --> 00:21:03,680
You fought for me today,

553
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:04,830
and took the punishment for me.

554
00:21:04,830 --> 00:21:06,480
I can't be disloyal.

555
00:21:21,820 --> 00:21:23,620
Don't you think our mom is weird?

556
00:21:23,970 --> 00:21:25,440
She fought everyone at school

557
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:26,500
to stand up for you,

558
00:21:26,790 --> 00:21:28,390
but now she's punishing you.

559
00:21:28,510 --> 00:21:29,710
What is she thinking?

560
00:21:30,270 --> 00:21:31,920
That's just how our mom is.

561
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:34,570
She changes her tune
in the blink of an eye.

562
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,760
Those little brats

563
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:37,920
are such jerks.

564
00:21:38,350 --> 00:21:40,410
Just scolding them today

565
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:41,640
was letting them off easy.

566
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,370
If you ask me,

567
00:21:42,380 --> 00:21:43,780
they need a good beating.

568
00:21:44,070 --> 00:21:46,270
Is this already too much for you to bear?

569
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:47,640
This is just the beginning.

570
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:49,030
They won't stop acting up.

571
00:21:49,030 --> 00:21:50,480
Then, honey,

572
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,200
please enlighten me.

573
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:01,830
You.

574
00:22:02,090 --> 00:22:03,300
Your daughter is just like you,

575
00:22:03,300 --> 00:22:03,960
stubborn

576
00:22:04,160 --> 00:22:05,090
and inflexible.

577
00:22:06,350 --> 00:22:07,790
About what happened today,

578
00:22:07,790 --> 00:22:09,200
even though it wasn't her fault,

579
00:22:09,200 --> 00:22:11,130
she didn't handle it right either.

580
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,030
She still hasn't figured it out.

581
00:22:14,030 --> 00:22:15,440
She's just different from others.

582
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,030
When people look at her,

583
00:22:16,030 --> 00:22:17,310
they find her weird.

584
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:18,160
Right?

585
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:20,310
If someone says something to you today,

586
00:22:20,310 --> 00:22:21,000
or touches you,

587
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:21,880
and you can't take it,

588
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:22,680
you get upset,

589
00:22:22,730 --> 00:22:23,110
and then you want to

590
00:22:23,110 --> 00:22:23,830
fight them,

591
00:22:24,070 --> 00:22:24,550
will you ever

592
00:22:24,550 --> 00:22:25,750
have a peaceful life?

593
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:27,900
Then what should we do?

594
00:22:27,930 --> 00:22:29,080
She should learn

595
00:22:29,110 --> 00:22:30,000
not to take other people's words

596
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:30,830
to heart.

597
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,590
Don't clash head-on with others.

598
00:22:34,590 --> 00:22:35,120
Exactly.

599
00:22:35,600 --> 00:22:35,960
Right?

600
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:37,970
Otherwise, she'll suffer in the future.

601
00:22:37,970 --> 00:22:38,750
Honey,

602
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:40,480
you are so wise

603
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:41,760
and generous.

604
00:22:49,590 --> 00:22:50,050
Come on.

605
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:08,480
Coward.

606
00:23:08,500 --> 00:23:09,070
Coward.

607
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:10,240
You're a coward who's afraid of bugs.

608
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,070
You're even afraid of bugs.

609
00:23:11,070 --> 00:23:12,030
Cao Xin, get up.

610
00:23:12,310 --> 00:23:12,880
Get up!

611
00:23:13,110 --> 00:23:13,710
Qinglian.

612
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:15,200
Get up, get up, get up.

613
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:15,800
Qinglian.

614
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:16,560
Qinglian.

615
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:18,000
Qinglian.

616
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:18,950
Leave.

617
00:23:20,110 --> 00:23:20,680
What's wrong?

618
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,310
Si.

619
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:22,920
What's wrong with Si?

620
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:23,320
She...

621
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:25,830
Si seems to be...

622
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:26,960
That...

623
00:23:28,270 --> 00:23:28,880
It's okay.

624
00:23:28,900 --> 00:23:29,700
Leave it to me.

625
00:23:30,790 --> 00:23:31,920
What's wrong with Cao Si?

626
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:32,880
I don't know.

627
00:23:35,270 --> 00:23:36,030
Si.

628
00:23:38,550 --> 00:23:39,070
Si.

629
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:39,590
Come.

630
00:23:40,950 --> 00:23:41,950
Come with Auntie.

631
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,350
Alright, it's okay.

632
00:23:53,450 --> 00:23:55,150
This is what happens when you grow up.

633
00:23:55,150 --> 00:23:56,080
Don't be afraid.

634
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:56,550
Okay.

635
00:23:56,550 --> 00:23:58,200
Come to Aunt Huo if you need anything.

636
00:23:58,200 --> 00:23:58,680
Got it.

637
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:01,400
Alright, it's okay.

638
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:02,350
Thank you, Qinglian.

639
00:24:02,350 --> 00:24:03,270
It's nothing.

640
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:06,680
Wait, wait.

641
00:24:10,440 --> 00:24:12,500
Make a cup of brown sugar water for Si.

642
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:13,770
Use hot water. Here.

643
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,000
This...

644
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:15,880
Brown sugar water.

645
00:24:15,880 --> 00:24:16,810
Do you want some?

646
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:19,010
Okay, thank you, Qinglian.

647
00:24:19,070 --> 00:24:20,000
You're welcome.

648
00:24:21,110 --> 00:24:21,550
Mom.

649
00:24:21,750 --> 00:24:24,150
Qi Shi and I want
some brown sugar water too.

650
00:24:24,490 --> 00:24:25,450
You're so nosy.

651
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:28,410
Hurry up, wash the vegetables
and hang them up to dry.

652
00:24:35,350 --> 00:24:35,950
Qinglian,

653
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:39,400
Cao's family is about to
celebrate a happy occasion.

654
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:40,400
What happy event?

655
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:41,440
Cao

656
00:24:42,030 --> 00:24:43,290
is finding love again.

657
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:45,790
What?

658
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:47,890
Look at that man.

659
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:49,310
Which man?

660
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:51,320
Don't make it so obvious.

661
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:52,270
That one.

662
00:24:52,350 --> 00:24:54,030
He's Director Wang from Mine One.

663
00:24:54,030 --> 00:24:54,680
The woman next to him

664
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,720
is his own sister.

665
00:24:56,030 --> 00:24:56,660
She's the one

666
00:24:56,660 --> 00:24:58,320
going on a blind date with Cao.

667
00:24:58,680 --> 00:24:59,310
The matchmaker

668
00:24:59,310 --> 00:25:01,110
is Director Zhang from our mine.

669
00:25:02,350 --> 00:25:03,110
I heard

670
00:25:03,310 --> 00:25:05,070
the woman is under thirty

671
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:07,480
and seems unable to have children.

672
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:08,610
So she got divorced.

673
00:25:08,750 --> 00:25:09,350
That's why she's willing

674
00:25:09,350 --> 00:25:10,240
to marry Cao

675
00:25:10,260 --> 00:25:11,550
and become a stepmother.

676
00:25:11,550 --> 00:25:12,410
Director Wang.

677
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:13,480
Don't worry.

678
00:25:13,960 --> 00:25:14,440
Girl.

679
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:15,920
He's a wonderful man.

680
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:16,350
Really?

681
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:16,810
Really.

682
00:25:17,550 --> 00:25:18,030
Director Zhang.

683
00:25:18,030 --> 00:25:19,090
Thank you for this.

684
00:25:19,110 --> 00:25:20,070
No problem.

685
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:26,640
Here.

686
00:25:28,590 --> 00:25:30,520
I'm taking some time off to go home.

687
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:31,920
If the boss asks,

688
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,310
just say my child has an emergency.

689
00:25:33,310 --> 00:25:34,400
Keep an eye on things for me.

690
00:25:34,400 --> 00:25:34,830
You...

691
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:36,240
Where are you going?

692
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,240
This is so sudden.

693
00:25:37,640 --> 00:25:37,960
Alright,

694
00:25:37,960 --> 00:25:39,240
I'll make it up to you another day.

695
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:39,840
Qinglian,

696
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:40,760
what's wrong?

697
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:43,500
Did Qi Shi get into trouble again?

698
00:25:55,270 --> 00:25:56,270
My mom is back.

699
00:25:57,030 --> 00:25:58,680
Isn't Mom on duty today?

700
00:25:59,510 --> 00:26:00,770
Quick, turn off the TV.

701
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:03,320
Cover it, cover it, cover it.

702
00:26:04,030 --> 00:26:04,430
Hurry.

703
00:26:04,510 --> 00:26:05,710
Write, write, write.

704
00:26:06,110 --> 00:26:06,590
Aihua.

705
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:08,600
Something happened.

706
00:26:14,300 --> 00:26:15,560
Isn't he insulting me?

707
00:26:16,960 --> 00:26:19,160
Does he think I'm not dedicated enough?

708
00:26:19,360 --> 00:26:20,750
He might be having a hard time,

709
00:26:20,750 --> 00:26:22,240
but I'm still alive.

710
00:26:22,270 --> 00:26:23,270
What does he mean?

711
00:26:23,350 --> 00:26:24,350
What did you hear?

712
00:26:24,790 --> 00:26:26,110
Let me hear what they're saying for a bit.

713
00:26:26,110 --> 00:26:27,310
I can't hear clearly.

714
00:26:27,730 --> 00:26:28,720
It sounds like only one of Mom
and someone else

715
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:29,650
can live.

716
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:31,000
What's impossible?

717
00:26:31,110 --> 00:26:32,240
Today at our store,

718
00:26:32,470 --> 00:26:34,530
Director Zhang brought people over.

719
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:36,270
Finding a stepmother for Cao Xin

720
00:26:36,270 --> 00:26:37,640
is a slap in our face.

721
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:40,520
Cao Xin is getting a stepmother.

722
00:26:41,510 --> 00:26:42,030
What?

723
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:43,750
I'm getting a stepmom.

724
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:45,070
People say,

725
00:26:45,350 --> 00:26:47,400
when you get a stepmom, you get a stepdad.

726
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:49,060
You're about to get a stepdad.

727
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:50,360
Where's your sister?

728
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:52,440
She's dancing at school.

729
00:26:52,460 --> 00:26:53,320
I'll go get her.

730
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:54,830
Don't go.

731
00:26:55,110 --> 00:26:56,440
My sister is soft-hearted.

732
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:57,750
She might just agree to let my dad

733
00:26:57,750 --> 00:26:58,720
find a stepmom.

734
00:26:59,400 --> 00:27:00,030
It's going to rain,

735
00:27:00,030 --> 00:27:01,510
and your dad is going to get married.

736
00:27:01,510 --> 00:27:02,510
You can't stop it.

737
00:27:02,590 --> 00:27:04,310
Haven't you always envied me

738
00:27:04,510 --> 00:27:05,510
for having a mom who would mend your pants

739
00:27:05,510 --> 00:27:06,710
and make buns for you?

740
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:08,000
Maybe your stepmom

741
00:27:08,450 --> 00:27:09,850
will be gentle and handy,

742
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,840
and not loud like my mom.

743
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:13,240
I don't want a stepmom.

744
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,070
Song Qiang in our class

745
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:16,750
has a stepmom.

746
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:17,480
Then his stepmom

747
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,940
had a baby brother for him.

748
00:27:19,030 --> 00:27:20,960
Once he got sick at school

749
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:22,090
and almost fainted.

750
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:22,830
His parents

751
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,310
didn't even come to pick him up.

752
00:27:24,310 --> 00:27:25,040
Don't worry.

753
00:27:25,070 --> 00:27:26,070
If you get sick

754
00:27:26,670 --> 00:27:27,590
and your parents don't care,

755
00:27:27,590 --> 00:27:28,550
I'll ask my parents to take care of you.

756
00:27:28,550 --> 00:27:29,830
I don't want a stepmom!

757
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:31,530
Let's go.

758
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:33,380
I'll take you to find your dad.

759
00:27:35,550 --> 00:27:37,160
Is that your stepmom?

760
00:27:37,260 --> 00:27:38,270
Look at this house.

761
00:27:38,270 --> 00:27:38,680
So new.

762
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:39,350
Really beautiful.

763
00:27:39,350 --> 00:27:39,790
Here.

764
00:27:39,810 --> 00:27:40,340
See that?

765
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:50,330
What do you want?

766
00:27:53,030 --> 00:27:54,560
Are you tickling yourself?

767
00:27:56,830 --> 00:27:58,240
My hand hurts so much.

768
00:27:59,160 --> 00:28:00,890
Cry now. Don't waste this slap.

769
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,110
Cry now.

770
00:28:18,760 --> 00:28:19,790
Hey, you three kids,

771
00:28:19,790 --> 00:28:20,930
what are you doing there?

772
00:28:20,930 --> 00:28:22,070
Isn't this Cao Dongfang's kid,

773
00:28:22,070 --> 00:28:23,000
Cao Xin? Cao Xin,

774
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,220
why are you crying?

775
00:28:25,030 --> 00:28:26,640
Cao Xin, why are you crying?

776
00:28:27,110 --> 00:28:28,570
Did your dad hit you again?

777
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:30,900
This...

778
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:31,590
Let me see.

779
00:28:32,790 --> 00:28:34,110
Cao Dongfang really hit you.

780
00:28:34,110 --> 00:28:35,050
Cao Xin said his dad

781
00:28:35,050 --> 00:28:36,180
loves to hit people.

782
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,590
He hits him whenever he's unhappy.

783
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:39,650
His mom got beaten a lot back then too.

784
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:41,680
Alright, Cao Xin.

785
00:28:41,680 --> 00:28:42,510
Stop crying.

786
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,270
Cao Xin, stop crying.

787
00:28:43,270 --> 00:28:44,030
Mom,

788
00:28:44,270 --> 00:28:46,720
I want my mom.

789
00:28:46,790 --> 00:28:47,720
Director Zhang.

790
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:50,040
Aren't you just messing around?

791
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:51,700
Director Wang.

792
00:28:51,700 --> 00:28:52,960
Listen to me, Director Wang.

793
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,030
Let me ask him later.

794
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:55,310
Dongfang is not that kind of person.

795
00:28:55,310 --> 00:28:55,970
Look at him.

796
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:56,880
What else is there to say?

797
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:57,610
Listen to me.

798
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:58,040
You...

799
00:28:58,160 --> 00:28:59,310
There must be a misunderstanding.

800
00:28:59,310 --> 00:29:00,110
What is there?

801
00:29:00,110 --> 00:29:01,110
Let me ask him.

802
00:29:01,130 --> 00:29:03,190
We'll talk after I figure things out.

803
00:29:10,610 --> 00:29:11,810
Stop crying, Cao Xin.

804
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:12,960
It's okay now.

805
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:14,480
They're gone.

806
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:21,280
What's wrong?

807
00:29:22,790 --> 00:29:23,850
Don't cry, Cao Xin.

808
00:29:29,590 --> 00:29:30,320
Don't cry.

809
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,000
Don't cry.

810
00:29:37,030 --> 00:29:39,960
I want my mom.

811
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:47,350
Here.

812
00:29:48,120 --> 00:29:49,250
Thank you, Aunt Huo.

813
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:51,180
-Thank you, Aunt Huo.
-You're welcome.

814
00:29:51,180 --> 00:29:52,070
Here. You're welcome.

815
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:53,510
Every time Cao Xin and Si

816
00:29:53,510 --> 00:29:54,750
come to our house for dinner,

817
00:29:54,750 --> 00:29:56,080
we have delicious food.

818
00:29:58,200 --> 00:30:00,260
The ribs Aunt Huo made are delicious.

819
00:30:01,350 --> 00:30:02,790
Eat more if you like it.

820
00:30:02,790 --> 00:30:03,750
If you want more later,

821
00:30:03,750 --> 00:30:04,700
just tell Aunt Huo,

822
00:30:04,700 --> 00:30:06,030
and I'll make it for you.

823
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:08,570
Just treat this place as your own home.

824
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,000
That's right.

825
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:10,920
What happened today

826
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:12,160
is between adults.

827
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:14,550
We adults have our ways to solve it,

828
00:30:14,550 --> 00:30:15,080
you know?

829
00:30:15,110 --> 00:30:15,550
Yes.

830
00:30:15,550 --> 00:30:17,590
If you encounter this kind of thing again,

831
00:30:17,590 --> 00:30:19,560
just tell me and Uncle Qi.

832
00:30:19,590 --> 00:30:20,850
We'll stand up for you,

833
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:21,680
got it?

834
00:30:22,110 --> 00:30:23,270
Don't try to

835
00:30:23,600 --> 00:30:24,590
solve it yourselves.

836
00:30:24,590 --> 00:30:25,610
How could you do that?

837
00:30:25,610 --> 00:30:26,140
You guys,

838
00:30:26,310 --> 00:30:27,130
aren't you risking

839
00:30:27,130 --> 00:30:28,060
your own health?

840
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:28,920
Mom,

841
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:30,240
you're not mad?

842
00:30:30,670 --> 00:30:31,640
I thought we ruined

843
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:32,640
Uncle Cao's date,

844
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:33,830
and would get a beating when we got back.

845
00:30:33,830 --> 00:30:35,490
You are going to get a beating.

846
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:37,200
You just know how to make trouble.

847
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:37,550
Dad,

848
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:39,980
why do I feel like you're quite happy?

849
00:30:40,070 --> 00:30:40,990
You've been grinning this whole time,

850
00:30:40,990 --> 00:30:42,190
and haven't stopped.

851
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:42,920
Am I?

852
00:30:43,270 --> 00:30:44,670
You saw right through me.

853
00:30:45,200 --> 00:30:45,660
Dad.

854
00:30:45,830 --> 00:30:47,230
Have you seen that woman?

855
00:30:48,030 --> 00:30:49,790
My brother said she's pretty.

856
00:30:50,880 --> 00:30:51,550
Is she pretty?

857
00:30:51,550 --> 00:30:52,280
Very pretty.

858
00:30:52,480 --> 00:30:53,350
And gentle.

859
00:30:53,550 --> 00:30:54,550
Gentle?

860
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:57,110
But none of us like her.

861
00:30:58,180 --> 00:30:59,130
Cao Xin and Si

862
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:01,420
don't want her to be their new mom either.

863
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:02,420
Cao Xin.

864
00:31:02,420 --> 00:31:03,920
You don't like the new mom either?

865
00:31:03,920 --> 00:31:05,120
I don't want a new mom.

866
00:31:06,590 --> 00:31:07,880
She'll be mean to us.

867
00:31:08,070 --> 00:31:10,460
Sister, you don't want
a new mom either, right?

868
00:31:10,460 --> 00:31:11,810
We don't need a new mom.

869
00:31:12,170 --> 00:31:12,920
We can often come

870
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,210
to Aunt Huo's house for dinner.

871
00:31:14,210 --> 00:31:15,080
Aunt Huo is

872
00:31:15,110 --> 00:31:16,230
just as good to us as our own mom.

873
00:31:16,230 --> 00:31:17,090
That's enough.

874
00:31:17,790 --> 00:31:18,810
Sister, you scared me to death.

875
00:31:18,810 --> 00:31:19,790
I thought you wanted

876
00:31:19,790 --> 00:31:20,440
a new mom.

877
00:31:20,510 --> 00:31:21,310
How could I?

878
00:31:21,830 --> 00:31:23,360
Aunt Huo is gentle and warm.

879
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:25,000
Uncle Qi tells jokes

880
00:31:25,030 --> 00:31:25,960
to make us happy.

881
00:31:26,270 --> 00:31:27,920
Your house is always lively.

882
00:31:28,270 --> 00:31:30,600
We really like coming to Aunt Huo's house.

883
00:31:31,160 --> 00:31:32,550
My mom is gentle?

884
00:31:33,030 --> 00:31:34,030
Lively?

885
00:31:34,590 --> 00:31:36,450
Isn't our family always chaotic?

886
00:31:36,880 --> 00:31:37,350
Right.

887
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:39,310
Isn't our family always chaotic?

888
00:31:39,310 --> 00:31:40,510
You three talk too much.

889
00:31:40,510 --> 00:31:41,880
Why do you have so much to say?

890
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:42,810
Hurry up and eat.

891
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:45,920
If you two miss your mom,

892
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:47,030
come to Aunt Huo's place

893
00:31:47,030 --> 00:31:48,270
anytime.

894
00:31:48,680 --> 00:31:49,940
Aunt Huo likes you too.

895
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:55,680
Director Zhang is really messing around.

896
00:31:56,310 --> 00:31:58,710
How can a new mom
be better than your own mom?

897
00:31:59,730 --> 00:32:00,720
Cao Xin, don't you like eating

898
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:01,980
sprout-stuffed buns?

899
00:32:02,070 --> 00:32:03,200
They're heating up in the pot.

900
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:04,550
Take some back with you later.

901
00:32:04,550 --> 00:32:04,960
Okay.

902
00:32:08,650 --> 00:32:09,720
I'll go find Cao later

903
00:32:09,720 --> 00:32:10,580
and have a chat.

904
00:32:14,790 --> 00:32:15,350
Honey.

905
00:32:15,750 --> 00:32:16,810
I thought about it.

906
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:18,920
I'd better go see him.

907
00:32:20,750 --> 00:32:21,790
This way, I can explain it to Dongfang

908
00:32:21,790 --> 00:32:22,790
clearly.

909
00:32:23,250 --> 00:32:24,800
You are a woman,

910
00:32:24,830 --> 00:32:26,560
it's harder for you to explain.

911
00:32:28,720 --> 00:32:29,320
Dongfang.

912
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:30,350
Aihua.

913
00:32:32,320 --> 00:32:33,820
I had someone buy

914
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:35,100
ten catties of mutton,

915
00:32:35,100 --> 00:32:36,200
ten catties of pork,

916
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:37,720
and ten catties of eggs
from the cafeteria.

917
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:39,550
We can't finish it all,
so I'm giving half of them to you.

918
00:32:39,550 --> 00:32:40,550
Keep it for yourselves.

919
00:32:40,550 --> 00:32:41,480
We don't need it.

920
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:42,740
It's for the children.

921
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:43,840
Take them.

922
00:32:44,110 --> 00:32:44,510
Okay.

923
00:32:45,590 --> 00:32:46,190
Thank you.

924
00:32:46,550 --> 00:32:47,150
Dongfang,

925
00:32:47,680 --> 00:32:48,410
have a drink.

926
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:49,160
Okay.

927
00:32:49,550 --> 00:32:50,080
Sit down.

928
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:53,570
Manyue has been gone for so many years.

929
00:32:54,350 --> 00:32:56,680
I really didn't want to find someone else.

930
00:32:57,950 --> 00:32:59,010
I was just thinking

931
00:32:59,710 --> 00:33:01,300
about how to raise

932
00:33:01,880 --> 00:33:02,830
these two kids.

933
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:05,160
Cao Xin is fine.

934
00:33:06,270 --> 00:33:07,200
He's a tough boy,

935
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:09,320
so

936
00:33:09,350 --> 00:33:10,410
it doesn't matter.

937
00:33:10,550 --> 00:33:11,510
But Si,

938
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:13,480
being a girl...

939
00:33:13,750 --> 00:33:16,070
If it weren't for Qinglian last time,

940
00:33:16,510 --> 00:33:18,200
I wouldn't have known how to handle

941
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:19,130
that situation.

942
00:33:20,350 --> 00:33:21,590
Then I thought,

943
00:33:21,890 --> 00:33:22,680
if we could have

944
00:33:22,680 --> 00:33:23,810
a woman in the house,

945
00:33:24,510 --> 00:33:25,770
that would be good too.

946
00:33:26,750 --> 00:33:27,350
Dongfang.

947
00:33:28,310 --> 00:33:30,400
We all see your difficulties.

948
00:33:32,750 --> 00:33:33,680
But look.

949
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:36,270
A stepmother

950
00:33:36,290 --> 00:33:37,440
is just not the same.

951
00:33:39,790 --> 00:33:40,590
And Cao Xin

952
00:33:41,070 --> 00:33:42,670
would be the first to object.

953
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:46,890
If only his mother were still here.

954
00:33:48,030 --> 00:33:50,290
Who says the Cao children have no mother?

955
00:33:52,670 --> 00:33:54,110
I am his real mother.

956
00:33:54,270 --> 00:33:55,000
I am.

957
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,080
Qinglian.

958
00:33:58,550 --> 00:33:59,680
Come sit for a while.

959
00:34:03,910 --> 00:34:04,750
There's a stool here.

960
00:34:04,750 --> 00:34:05,160
Okay.

961
00:34:12,090 --> 00:34:12,690
Dongfang.

962
00:34:13,420 --> 00:34:14,480
Please don't mind.

963
00:34:15,360 --> 00:34:17,690
I'll take care of Si's matters
from now on.

964
00:34:18,409 --> 00:34:19,929
As long as I am alive,

965
00:34:20,010 --> 00:34:20,670
I will treat Si

966
00:34:20,670 --> 00:34:21,760
as my own daughter.

967
00:34:23,150 --> 00:34:24,960
I'll vet her boyfriends for her.

968
00:34:25,060 --> 00:34:27,110
I'll sew her quilt covers
when she gets married.

969
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:29,310
I won't let anyone say she has no mother.

970
00:34:33,510 --> 00:34:34,310
How could I...

971
00:34:35,360 --> 00:34:36,760
How could I mind?

972
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:38,800
I can't thank you enough.

973
00:34:39,440 --> 00:34:39,900
Cheers.

974
00:34:43,960 --> 00:34:44,690
Drink less.

975
00:34:45,739 --> 00:34:46,670
You can't drink.

976
00:34:48,670 --> 00:34:50,330
Dongfang, about your matter,

977
00:34:50,920 --> 00:34:53,000
we will both keep it in mind.

978
00:34:53,030 --> 00:34:54,800
If there's anyone suitable in the future,

979
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:56,840
I'll keep an eye out for you.

980
00:34:58,000 --> 00:34:59,030
But the key is,

981
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:01,360
the kids have to like her.

982
00:35:01,760 --> 00:35:02,710
Right?

983
00:35:02,930 --> 00:35:03,670
Don't let it end up

984
00:35:03,670 --> 00:35:04,510
like today.

985
00:35:04,530 --> 00:35:05,660
Nothing is settled yet,

986
00:35:05,660 --> 00:35:06,990
and it's already a mess.

987
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:09,960
Then it's better not to look for one.

988
00:35:13,590 --> 00:35:15,230
Yes, that makes sense.

989
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:17,210
Makes sense.

990
00:35:19,800 --> 00:35:20,800
Cheers.

991
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:21,300
Cheers.

992
00:35:31,760 --> 00:35:32,820
Look in the mirror.

993
00:35:33,630 --> 00:35:35,400
Among the children performing today,

994
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:35,920
Si

995
00:35:35,940 --> 00:35:37,600
is definitely the prettiest.

996
00:35:39,630 --> 00:35:41,030
Hurry up.

997
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:42,920
We still have to buy breakfast later.

998
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:43,710
There's no time to make it.

999
00:35:43,710 --> 00:35:44,840
Wake those two boys up.

1000
00:35:44,840 --> 00:35:45,770
They'll be late.

1001
00:35:46,030 --> 00:35:46,440
Okay.

1002
00:35:47,070 --> 00:35:47,550
Aihua.

1003
00:35:47,710 --> 00:35:48,710
Here, breakfast.

1004
00:35:50,070 --> 00:35:50,760
Thank you.

1005
00:35:51,230 --> 00:35:52,230
Don't mention it.

1006
00:35:53,660 --> 00:35:55,060
Look how pretty Si is.

1007
00:35:55,510 --> 00:35:57,320
Si is the prettiest.

1008
00:35:58,340 --> 00:35:59,420
Are you happy, Si?

1009
00:36:00,030 --> 00:36:01,090
Si, just eat here.

1010
00:36:01,150 --> 00:36:01,630
Don't go back.

1011
00:36:01,630 --> 00:36:02,000
Okay,

1012
00:36:02,230 --> 00:36:03,290
that'll save time.

1013
00:36:03,670 --> 00:36:05,320
Get up quickly.

1014
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:15,510
My God.

1015
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:18,360
Is this a fairy descending to earth?

1016
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:30,510
Two, da, da, three, da, da,

1017
00:36:30,710 --> 00:36:33,760
four, da, da, five, da, da,

1018
00:36:34,030 --> 00:36:37,110
six, da, da, seven, da, da,

1019
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,760
eight, da, da.

1020
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:41,920
One, da, da, two, da, da,

1021
00:36:42,190 --> 00:36:45,360
three, da, da, four, da, da,

1022
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:48,630
five, da, da, six, da, da,

1023
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:49,590
seven, da, da.

1024
00:36:49,590 --> 00:36:50,880
What are you looking at?

1025
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:52,080
You want to dance too?

1026
00:36:52,510 --> 00:36:53,440
Forget it.

1027
00:36:54,150 --> 00:36:55,350
You're not suitable.

1028
00:36:56,000 --> 00:36:57,070
None of your business.

1029
00:36:57,070 --> 00:36:57,920
The midterm exam results

1030
00:36:57,920 --> 00:36:58,720
will be posted soon.

1031
00:36:58,720 --> 00:37:00,450
Let's see how you show off then.

1032
00:37:01,770 --> 00:37:02,290
Not bad.

1033
00:37:02,320 --> 00:37:04,520
Come on, let's practice in groups next.

1034
00:37:12,710 --> 00:37:13,400
Qi Shi.

1035
00:37:15,710 --> 00:37:17,400
Come on, let's dance together.

1036
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:18,280
Si.

1037
00:37:19,190 --> 00:37:20,120
I don't know how.

1038
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:21,780
I'll teach you.

1039
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:24,860
Come on.

1040
00:37:26,760 --> 00:37:28,030
Follow my movements.

1041
00:37:29,360 --> 00:37:30,480
Stand like this.

1042
00:37:31,230 --> 00:37:31,670
Right.

1043
00:37:33,400 --> 00:37:33,800
Right.

1044
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:35,880
Boring.

1045
00:37:35,880 --> 00:37:38,190
Cao Xin is always in first place.

1046
00:37:38,400 --> 00:37:39,930
Not necessarily this time.

1047
00:37:45,320 --> 00:37:47,230
First place is actually Qi Shi.

1048
00:37:47,590 --> 00:37:49,090
Cao Xin is second.

1049
00:37:52,230 --> 00:37:53,430
How is that possible?

1050
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:55,950
Hello, Uncle Cao.

1051
00:37:56,290 --> 00:37:56,920
Qi Shi.

1052
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:58,920
Wait, wait.

1053
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:01,640
Wait a minute.

1054
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:07,880
Come here.

1055
00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:09,560
Come here.

1056
00:38:11,190 --> 00:38:11,760
Look.

1057
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:13,610
What is this good stuff?

1058
00:38:13,630 --> 00:38:15,940
The bow hairpins I wanted the most!

1059
00:38:16,690 --> 00:38:17,490
That's right.

1060
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,520
Come, put it on and let me see.

1061
00:38:20,420 --> 00:38:21,220
Let me hold it.

1062
00:38:25,650 --> 00:38:26,650
Does it look good?

1063
00:38:27,480 --> 00:38:28,610
It looks beautiful.

1064
00:38:28,920 --> 00:38:30,670
Qi Shi is Qingwu Town's

1065
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:31,800
prettiest and

1066
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:33,060
smartest little girl,

1067
00:38:33,150 --> 00:38:33,630
right?

1068
00:38:34,510 --> 00:38:35,110
How about this?

1069
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:35,840
Next time

1070
00:38:36,190 --> 00:38:37,410
when you get first place again,

1071
00:38:37,410 --> 00:38:38,160
tell me

1072
00:38:38,190 --> 00:38:39,000
what you want.

1073
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:40,960
Anything, even if it's expensive,

1074
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:42,440
I will definitely buy it for you.

1075
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:42,960
Okay?

1076
00:38:44,800 --> 00:38:45,630
Uncle Cao.

1077
00:38:46,230 --> 00:38:47,280
My parents said

1078
00:38:47,590 --> 00:38:48,360
I shouldn't just

1079
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:49,760
take things from others.

1080
00:38:49,920 --> 00:38:51,320
They said it's impolite.

1081
00:38:51,500 --> 00:38:52,730
I'm not an outsider.

1082
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:53,400
It's okay.

1083
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:55,840
I know you are good to me, Uncle Cao.

1084
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:58,110
Having the hairpins is enough.

1085
00:38:58,110 --> 00:38:59,280
I like them very much.

1086
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,480
Thank you, Uncle Cao.

1087
00:39:00,670 --> 00:39:01,600
You're welcome.

1088
00:39:02,110 --> 00:39:03,660
You don't have to
take other people's things,

1089
00:39:03,660 --> 00:39:04,920
but when it comes to Uncle Cao's things,

1090
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:05,800
you must take them.

1091
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:06,360
Hear me?

1092
00:39:06,740 --> 00:39:07,340
Take them.

1093
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:10,320
Alright, hold them well.

1094
00:39:12,120 --> 00:39:13,120
Okay, go home now.

1095
00:39:13,670 --> 00:39:14,110
Okay.

1096
00:39:21,760 --> 00:39:22,840
Look at you.

1097
00:39:23,710 --> 00:39:25,000
Mom and Dad work so hard

1098
00:39:25,030 --> 00:39:25,890
to pay for your schooling.

1099
00:39:25,890 --> 00:39:27,000
Look at your grades.

1100
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:29,360
You failed two out of four subjects.

1101
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:30,360
Do you want to

1102
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:31,210
be like your dad

1103
00:39:31,210 --> 00:39:33,670
and go down the mine
to dig coal in the future?

1104
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:34,850
Come, let me see.

1105
00:39:35,630 --> 00:39:38,760
Only the score for Ideology and Morality
is a bit higher.

1106
00:39:39,710 --> 00:39:40,760
You kid,

1107
00:39:40,890 --> 00:39:42,110
I don't know who you take after.

1108
00:39:42,110 --> 00:39:43,840
You just grew tall for nothing.

1109
00:39:43,960 --> 00:39:46,760
This score is not even as high
as my blood pressure.

1110
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:47,400
Mom.

1111
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:49,190
I had an exam too.

1112
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:50,620
Give them to me.

1113
00:39:51,030 --> 00:39:51,630
Let me see.

1114
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:53,370
How is it?

1115
00:39:54,230 --> 00:39:56,150
Look at your sister.

1116
00:39:57,510 --> 00:39:59,370
She got perfect scores in every subject.

1117
00:39:59,370 --> 00:40:00,840
We eat the same food in this family.

1118
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:02,030
Where did your food go?

1119
00:40:02,030 --> 00:40:03,590
Did it go into a dog's belly?

1120
00:40:04,540 --> 00:40:05,650
That's my Sweetie.

1121
00:40:06,230 --> 00:40:07,360
She has a good brain.

1122
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:08,840
She takes after me in this.

1123
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:09,400
Dad.

1124
00:40:09,910 --> 00:40:11,180
I will study hard.

1125
00:40:11,410 --> 00:40:13,000
When I grow up, I'll support you,

1126
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:15,000
so you won't have to go down the mine.

1127
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:17,120
Come here, come here, come here.

1128
00:40:17,190 --> 00:40:18,400
Aren't you going to support me?

1129
00:40:18,400 --> 00:40:19,710
She'll support us all.

1130
00:40:21,230 --> 00:40:23,230
You really are my sweet little girl.

1131
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:24,880
You know how to care for

1132
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:26,320
Mom and Dad at such a young age.

1133
00:40:26,320 --> 00:40:28,320
You even know
it's hard for Dad to work in the mine.

1134
00:40:28,320 --> 00:40:28,800
Right?

1135
00:40:29,550 --> 00:40:31,150
How did Cao Xin do on the exam?

1136
00:40:31,150 --> 00:40:31,670
Him?

1137
00:40:32,430 --> 00:40:34,090
He's long been no match for me.

1138
00:40:34,850 --> 00:40:35,920
You're just showing off.

1139
00:40:35,920 --> 00:40:37,320
You're not modest at all.

1140
00:40:37,710 --> 00:40:38,480
Cao Xin used to

1141
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:39,320
always get first place,

1142
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:41,250
but he was never as arrogant as you.

1143
00:40:41,670 --> 00:40:43,800
Let's see what score you get next time.

1144
00:40:45,510 --> 00:40:47,040
Is this the essay you wrote?

1145
00:40:51,230 --> 00:40:51,760
Cao Xin.

1146
00:40:53,550 --> 00:40:54,000
Look.

1147
00:40:55,070 --> 00:40:55,800
What is this?

1148
00:40:57,780 --> 00:40:58,910
A camera.

1149
00:40:59,150 --> 00:40:59,950
Do you like it?

1150
00:41:01,880 --> 00:41:02,920
I promised you

1151
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:04,670
that if you got first place,

1152
00:41:04,670 --> 00:41:06,320
I'd buy you a camera.

1153
00:41:07,150 --> 00:41:09,360
Even though you didn't
get first place this time,

1154
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:10,800
I still bought it

1155
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:12,440
because I promised you.

1156
00:41:12,760 --> 00:41:15,220
You're not mad
that I didn't get first place?

1157
00:41:15,280 --> 00:41:17,550
You win some, you lose some.

1158
00:41:18,360 --> 00:41:20,550
Not getting first place once in a while

1159
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:21,610
is something

1160
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,280
I can understand.

1161
00:41:23,780 --> 00:41:24,660
But I believe

1162
00:41:24,870 --> 00:41:25,730
that next time,

1163
00:41:25,880 --> 00:41:27,550
